UNIT boundedMap
KIND FUNCTIONAL
FIDELITY spec
SIG boundedMap(input, concurrency, gate) -> Promise<Array>
# Maps over the input with a concurrency bound; completions arrive through the injected gate.
PAR the per-item mappings are independent sub-traces
INVARIANT output is keyed by INPUT position — invariant under interleaving
INVARIANT at most min(concurrency, n) items are in flight at any instant
